Specifications
--------------

No specification text is reproduced, and no specification document is
redistributed. Field names, enumeration values, status codes, paths and
message names are interface facts every implementation must use; the
comments cite clause numbers in our own words.

- OCPI 2.2.1 (EVRoaming Foundation, github.com/ocpi/ocpi, tag 2.2.1):
  published under CC BY-ND 4.0. Used for facts only.
- OICP 2.3 (Hubject GmbH, github.com/hubject/oicp and
  github.com/hubject/oicp-cpo-2.3-api-doc): published under CC BY-SA
  4.0. Used for facts only; none of its text, examples or OpenAPI files
  are copied into this repository. The test-only module oicpspec/
  fetches the OpenAPI files at a pinned commit when its tests run.
- OSCP 2.0 (Open Charge Alliance): the specification is CC BY-ND 4.0 and
  is not redistributed; its schemas are, as above.

Interop tests (interop/, a separate test-only module)
-----------------------------------------------------

interop/peer/Dockerfile installs extrawest-ocpi 2025.7.16 (MIT,
Copyright (c) 2023 Extrawest, github.com/extrawest/extrawest_ocpi; it
depends on FastAPI, httpx and pydantic, all MIT or BSD-3-Clause) and
uvicorn 0.30.6 (BSD-3-Clause) from PyPI into a python:3.11.9-slim image
at test time; nothing of them is copied into this repository.
interop/peer/app.py is our own script that runs that package.

interop/oscppeer/Dockerfile installs pyoscp 0.1.0 (MIT, Copyright (c)
2022 Florian Maurer, github.com/NOWUM/pyoscp) with Flask, Werkzeug,
Flask-RESTX, requests, packaging and python-dateutil (BSD-3-Clause,
Apache-2.0 or dual Apache-2.0/BSD) from PyPI into a python:3.11.9-slim
image at test time; nothing of them is copied into this repository.
interop/oscppeer/app.py is our own script that runs that package.

oicpspec/ (a separate test-only module) uses gopkg.in/yaml.v3 (MIT and
Apache-2.0) and github.com/santhosh-tekuri/jsonschema/v6 (Apache-2.0).

